MAIN
MOVE TEMP 9 4
MOVE TEMP 10 HALLOCATE TEMP 9
MOVE TEMP 0 TEMP 10
MOVE TEMP 11 4
MOVE TEMP 12 HALLOCATE TEMP 11
MOVE TEMP 1 TEMP 12
MOVE TEMP 13 TEMP 1
HSTORE TEMP 0 0 TEMP 13
MOVE TEMP 14 ObjectTest_ved_CreateAndUse
HSTORE TEMP 1 0 TEMP 14
HLOAD TEMP 2 TEMP 0 0
HLOAD TEMP 3 TEMP 2 0
MOVE TEMP 15 CALL TEMP 3 ( TEMP 0 )
MOVE TEMP 4 TEMP 15
PRINT TEMP 4
END
ObjectTest_ved_CreateAndUse [ 1 ]
BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 16 4
MOVE TEMP 17 HALLOCATE TEMP 16
MOVE TEMP 3 TEMP 17
MOVE TEMP 18 4
MOVE TEMP 19 HALLOCATE TEMP 18
MOVE TEMP 4 TEMP 19
MOVE TEMP 20 TEMP 4
HSTORE TEMP 3 0 TEMP 20
MOVE TEMP 21 Helper_ved_GetValue
HSTORE TEMP 4 0 TEMP 21
MOVE TEMP 1 TEMP 3
HLOAD TEMP 5 TEMP 1 0
HLOAD TEMP 6 TEMP 5 0
MOVE TEMP 22 CALL TEMP 6 ( TEMP 1 )
MOVE TEMP 7 TEMP 22
MOVE TEMP 2 TEMP 7
PRINT TEMP 2
MOVE TEMP 23 0
MOVE TEMP 8 TEMP 23

RETURN TEMP 8
END
Helper_ved_GetValue [ 1 ]
BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 24 42
MOVE TEMP 1 TEMP 24

RETURN TEMP 1
END

